{"text": " E\u0219ti din Bor\u0219a, Vi\u0219eu sau Moisei \u0219i cau\u021bi o caban\u0103 perfect\u0103 pentru un party. Uite de ce cabana noastr\u0103 e perfect\u0103. Ai un living open space foarte spa\u021bios, o mas\u0103 foarte mare, unde \u00een camp e cu siguran\u021b\u0103 toat\u0103 ga\u0219ca. Dou\u0103 paturi sus, \u00een cas c\u0103 ii va i se face somn, o baie, da, buc\u0103t\u0103rie complet utilat\u0103. \u0218i aici, view-ul \u0103sta absolut superb, da, toate geamurile astea care \u00ee\u021bi deschid cumva toat\u0103 priverii \u0219tia\u021ba superb\u0103. Canapeaua asta, deci, e ce trebuie. \u0218i partea cea mai mi\u0219to, afar\u0103, ave\u021bi teras\u0103, fire pit \u0219i jacuzzi, unde o s\u0103 pute\u021bi s\u0103 sta\u021bi toat\u0103 noaptea sub cerul \u00eenstelat cu un pahar de prost secund m\u00e2n\u0103. \u0218i nici nu sunt vecini pe care po\u021bi s\u0103 \u00eei deranjezi, practic, e loca\u021bia perfect\u0103 pentru orice eveniment mai r\u0103str\u00e2ns. Dac\u0103 \u0219i tu ai vrea s\u0103 \u00ee\u021bi organizezi petrecera la Monte South, scrie parte \u00een comentarii iar noi o s\u0103 strimitem datele noastre de contact.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 4.5, "text": " E\u0219ti din Bor\u0219a, Vi\u0219eu sau Moisei \u0219i cau\u021bi o caban\u0103 perfect\u0103 pentru un party.", "tokens": [50364, 462, 10355, 7317, 3791, 13739, 10355, 64, 11, 6626, 10355, 23685, 17828, 3335, 908, 72, 17060, 42951, 19999, 277, 5487, 282, 4089, 2176, 4089, 31718, 517, 3595, 13, 50589], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2484909849740117, "compression_ratio": 1.570967741935484, "no_speech_prob": 0.4467962086200714}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 4.5, "end": 7.0, "text": " Uite de ce cabana noastr\u0103 e perfect\u0103.", "tokens": [50589, 624, 642, 368, 1769, 5487, 2095, 572, 525, 81, 4089, 308, 2176, 4089, 13, 50714], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.2484909849740117, "compression_ratio": 1.570967741935484, "no_